# Pooled clustering + top markers + ASPC/stroma specificity ratio per gene
#
# What this script does (per group):
# 1) Pool samples (prefix cell barcodes with sample_id__)
# 2) Cluster pooled data (resolution search to get ~8 clusters)
# 3) Output top 100 marker genes per cluster
# 4) Compute per-gene "aspc_specific_ratio" using a USER-SPECIFIED target cluster
#    - For NEPC groups: target is "ASPC" (Adipose stem/progenitor)
#    - For Adeno groups: target is "stroma/fibroblast" cluster (still written as aspc_specific_ratio for convenience)
#
# Ratio definition (per gene):
#   ratio = mean(expr in target cluster) / max(mean(expr in other clusters))
# using pseudo-bulk means on the log-normalized "data" layer.
#
# Outputs (cfg$out_dir):
# - <group>_cluster_counts.csv
# - <group>_cluster_markers_top100.csv
# - <group>_aspc_specific_ratio.csv              (gene-level ratios + tau)
# - <group>_seurat.rds                           (optional)

